         "question": "1.Accessory Compatibility",
         "answerBlocks": [
          {
           "type": "rich-text",
           "content": "<div>Not compatible with <strong>Hotend with Stainless Steel Nozzle 0.2 mm</strong>.</div>",
           "id": "comp_1789712188602_15j2n8i8l"
          }
         ],
         "id": "comp_1789712188602_ekgxtqb1q"
        },
        {
         "question": "2.Drying Recommendations",
         "answerBlocks": [
          {
           "type": "rich-text",
           "content": "<ul>\n<li>Dry before use to ensure the best print quality and consistent finish. Store in a dry environment after use. For more details, please refer to: <a href=\"https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/filament-acc/filament/dry-filament\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42; text-decoration: underline;\">Filament drying instructions</span></span></a> on WIKI.</li>\n<li>For opened filament, we recommend drying before use according to the wiki&rsquo;s recommended temperature and time settings.</li>\n</ul>",
           "id": "comp_1789712188602_ffj4wsno0"
          }
         ],
         "id": "comp_1789712188602_q9qx38g73"
        },
        {
         "question": "3.Safety Tips",
         "answerBlocks": [
          {
           "type": "rich-text",
           "content": "<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"UYkSd7IvUoVreQxHLV5cA0mpnBg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnwYFCemC8F1JknzOfrKazCd\">Please store the filament in a cool, dark, and dry environment away from direct sunlight and high temperatures.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnwYFCemC8F1JknzOfrKazCd\">Please keep filament and any broken fragments out of reach of infants, children, and pets to prevent swallowing or choking.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnwYFCemC8F1JknzOfrKazCd\">Please print this filament in a well-ventilated area, or install an effective air filtration or exhaust system.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnwYFCemC8F1JknzOfrKazCd\">As this filament is not food-grade, please avoid using finished prints for food storage or contact.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
           "id": "comp_1789712188602_3ji5p7wq5"
          }
         ],
         "id": "comp_1789712188602_5cw9u6ux0"
        }
       ]
      }
